<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Katakana Loanword Challenge</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        
        <div id="screen-intro" class="screen active">
            <h1 class="title">Katakana Loanword Challenge</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Master Japanese Gairaigo (Foreign Loanwords)</p>
            
            <div class="card intro-card">
                <h2>Welcome, Students!</h2>
                <p>Japanese uses <strong>Katakana</strong> to spell foreign words (<em>Gairaigo</em>). Because Japanese relies on a moraic structure (consonant-vowel syllables), English words are adapted to fit Japanese phonetics. For example, "Sandwich" becomes "Sandoitchi" (サンドイッチ) and "McDonald's" becomes "Makudonarudo" (マクドナルド).</p>
                
                <h3>Game Rules</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Answer <strong>50 questions</strong> selected from a bank of 200 loanwords.</li>
                    <li><strong>Fast Answer (≤ 5s):</strong> 2 Points</li>
                    <li><strong>Slow Answer (> 5s):</strong> 1 Point</li>
                    <li><strong>Incorrect Answer:</strong> 0 Points</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Student Setup</h3>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="student-name">Your Full Name:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="student-name" placeholder="e.g., Jane Doe" required>
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="student-photo">Upload Your Photo (for Certificate):</label>
                    <input type="file" id="student-photo" accept="image/*">
                </div>

                <h3>Game Mode Settings</h3>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Script Display Mode:</label>
                    <select id="setting-script">
                        <option value="romaji">Romaji (Phonetic English Characters)</option>
                        <option value="katakana">Katakana (Japanese Script)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Translation Direction:</label>
                    <select id="setting-direction">
                        <option value="jp-to-en">Japanese → English</option>
                        <option value="en-to-jp">English → Japanese</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-start">Start Game</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="screen-quiz" class="screen">
            <div class="quiz-header card">
                <div class="hud-item">
                    <span class="hud-label">Progress</span>
                    <span class="hud-value" id="hud-progress">1 / 50</span>
                </div>
                <div class="hud-item">
                    <span class="hud-label">Question Timer</span>
                    <span class="hud-value" id="hud-timer">0s</span>
                </div>
                <div class="hud-item highlight">
                    <span class="hud-label">Total Score</span>
                    <span class="hud-value" id="hud-score">0</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card question-card">
                <div class="prompt-box">
                    <span class="prompt-label">Translate this word:</span>
                    <h2 id="question-text" class="question-text">---</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="options-grid" id="options-container">
                    </div>

                <div id="feedback-box" class="feedback-box hidden">
                    <h3 id="feedback-title"></h3>
                    <p id="feedback-text"></p>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="btn-next">Next Question</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="screen-result" class="screen">
            <h1 class="title">Course Completion Certificate</h1>
            
            <div class="instruction-banner">
                <p>📷 <strong>Professors & Students:</strong> Please take a screenshot or click "Download Certificate" below to record your final score!</p>
            </div>

            <div id="certificate-wrapper" class="certificate-container">
                <div id="certificate-photo" class="cert-photo-bg"></div>
                <div class="cert-overlay">
                    <div class="cert-header">
                        <h2>CERTIFICATE OF ACHIEVEMENT</h2>
                        <p>Japanese Language Studies — Katakana & Loanwords</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cert-body">
                        <p class="cert-text">This certifies that</p>
                        <h1 class="cert-name" id="cert-name">Student Name</h1>
                        <p class="cert-text">has successfully completed the 50-Item Katakana Challenge.</p>

                        <div class="cert-stats">
                            <div class="stat-box">
                                <span class="stat-label">FINAL SCORE</span>
                                <span class="stat-value" id="cert-score">0 / 100</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-box">
                                <span class="stat-label">TOTAL TIME</span>
                                <span class="stat-value" id="cert-time">00:00</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-box">
                                <span class="stat-label">ACCURACY</span>
                                <span class="stat-value" id="cert-accuracy">0%</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="cert-details">
                            <p><strong>Activity Mode:</strong> <span id="cert-mode">---</span></p>
                            <p><strong>Date Completed:</strong> <span id="cert-date">---</span></p>
                        </div>

                        <p class="cert-note">🎉 Congratulations on mastering Japanese Gairaigo pronunciation!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="action-buttons">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-download">Download Certificate (PNG)</button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="location.reload()">Restart Game</button>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2canvas/1.4.1/html2canvas.min.js"></script>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
